1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:05,400
Such a potent poison... It really is Hunchback Meng.

25
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,640
Stay attentive.

26
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,840
If you detect any trace of Hunchback Meng,

27
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:15,720
tell me immediately.

28
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:19,000
Master,

29
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:23,400
are we going after that Soul Formation old toad ?

30
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:25,560
Just do as you're told.

31
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:35,920
Why do I always have to do all the hard work ?

32
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:39,880
How shameless ! You're just scared of that Soul Formation cultivator.

33
00:02:57,720 --> 00:02:59,840
There's another alpha beast in this tornado.

34
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:09,200
It's probing me...

35
00:03:16,040 --> 00:03:16,840
Kill it.

36
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:50,360
False Nascent Soul ?

37
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:08,960
I can't get close.

38
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,240
I can't fight it directly.

39
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:36,760
Retreat another 10 zhang.

40
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:49,760
I refuse to believe my Divine Sense can't cut you !

41
00:04:58,440 --> 00:05:01,720
False Nascent Soul is the limit of what I can face.

42
00:05:02,960 --> 00:05:05,320
There must be other alpha beasts in tornadoes.

43
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:18,080
As I thought,

44
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:20,480
the closer we get to the end,

45
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,360
the stronger the beasts.

46
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:25,200
Master ! Master !

47
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:28,800
I found that old toad !

48
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:48,320
Little ant that poisoned my brethren,

49
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:54,160
I will unleash divine punishment upon you !

50
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:54,400
Tornado Beast King
Peak Late stage Soul Formation

51
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,640
Peak Late stage Soul Formation !?

52
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:11,800
This is...

53
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:16,080
That old bastard and his toad

54
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:18,120
relied on their Soul Formation cultivation

55
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,880
to fight their way through.

56
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:20,680
But then...

57
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:24,560
it attracted this trial's king.

58
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:27,520
Thankfully, I didn't act recklessly.

59
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:29,560
The consequences would've been terrible.

60
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,840
Li Tian !

61
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,120
Let's let him fight.

62
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:58,640
Even if he doesn't die, he'll be severely injured.

63
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,200
Master,

64
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:03,040
the end of the first trial is right there.

65
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:05,880
Shouldn't we take advantage of the chaos to leave ?

66
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:17,680
Not now,

67
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:18,720
get closer.

68
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:25,320
Just do what you're told !

69
00:08:32,760 --> 00:08:33,840
Go a bit closer,

70
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,520
we can't see from far away.

71
00:08:36,160 --> 00:08:38,440
What a great spectacle !

72
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,080
Damn beast !

73
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:54,440
You pushed me this far !

74
00:08:57,560 --> 00:09:00,120
This black tower cannot stop me.

75
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:03,160
You slaughtered countless of my brethren.

76
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:05,160
Little ant,

77
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:09,240
come out and die !

78
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:17,360
Bastard ! Bastard !

79
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:21,360
I... I cannot die here !

80
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:28,480
Li Tian...

81
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:31,360
Come to think of it,

82
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:33,880
you've only been with me for 1000 years.

83
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:40,280
I'm sorry Li Tian.

84
00:09:40,680 --> 00:09:43,240
This old man needs to live a few more years !

85
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:50,000
This is your fate.

86
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:53,320
Blame Tornado Beast King for it !

87
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:12,840
Hahahahaha !

88
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:21,400
We mustn't waste your body either.

89
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:56,560
You actually devoured the core of your high quality Spirit Beast.

90
00:10:57,320 --> 00:11:00,320
I raised it for 1000 years

91
00:11:01,160 --> 00:11:04,240
step by step until high quality.

92
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:09,880
It almost became a Desolate Beast.

93
00:11:10,680 --> 00:11:12,320
Just one more step

94
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:16,680
and Li Tian would've become a Desolate Beast !

95
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:18,400
It's your fault !

96
00:11:18,480 --> 00:11:20,800
You forced me to devour Li Tian !

97
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:25,160
How laughable, it was completely loyal to you.

98
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:27,480
But in the end

99
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:32,040
you only raised it for it to become a pill.

100
00:11:32,440 --> 00:11:34,200
So what if I did ?

101
00:11:34,560 --> 00:11:36,360
What does it change ?

102
00:11:36,440 --> 00:11:37,640
Enough talk !

103
00:11:38,160 --> 00:11:41,520
Now that I'm also at Peak Late stage Soul Formation,

104
00:11:42,280 --> 00:11:44,000
let's have a fight,

105
00:11:44,280 --> 00:11:46,920
you damn beast !

106
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:53,080
Die !

107
00:12:15,680 --> 00:12:16,880
Nine Nethers Poison,

108
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:18,560
explode !

109
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:49,760
My subjects,

110
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:53,800
sacrifice your bodies for your king !

111
00:13:16,920 --> 00:13:17,720
Go !

112
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:03,520
Your life artifact is shattered.

113
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:06,600
Now die !

114
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:09,120
Damn beast...

115
00:14:09,680 --> 00:14:12,360
Did you think my Poison King Cauldron

116
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:16,040
was forged with just any amount of Heaven Severing Poison ?

117
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:27,800
I want you, damn beast, to pay with your life for Li Tian !

118
00:14:33,160 --> 00:14:34,760
Heaven Severing Poison...

119
00:14:34,880 --> 00:14:36,320
Explode for me !

120
00:14:36,400 --> 00:14:39,000
Explode !

121
00:15:02,560 --> 00:15:04,560
He actually won !

122
00:15:06,360 --> 00:15:08,040
Quick, let's go, let's go !

123
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:10,400
If that old toad finds us

124
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:11,960
we won't be able to leave !

125
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:13,920
Get closer.

126
00:15:16,360 --> 00:15:17,560
Are you crazy !?

127
00:15:31,280 --> 00:15:32,320
With my cultivation,

128
00:15:32,680 --> 00:15:34,240
the trials will be perilous.

129
00:15:34,400 --> 00:15:36,440
A Soul Formation's bag of holding

130
00:15:37,120 --> 00:15:38,320
might give me an edge.

131
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:41,520
That's a Soul Formation cultivator !

132
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:44,160
He might be one step in the grave

133
00:15:44,800 --> 00:15:46,160
but killing you

134
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:49,360
is as easy as crushing an ant  !

135
00:15:50,080 --> 00:15:51,240
I can't kill him

136
00:15:51,920 --> 00:15:53,610
but that doesn't mean he can't die.

137
00:15:54,640 --> 00:15:55,720
Either we go all in

138
00:15:56,320 --> 00:15:57,600
or we don't try at all.

139
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:08,080
Mere Core Formation and Nascent Soul beasts dare to catch me ?

140
00:16:08,560 --> 00:16:09,800
Ridiculous.

141
00:16:13,880 --> 00:16:14,960
It's you !

142
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:18,600
We're dead !

143
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:25,520
How dare you ?

144
00:16:27,160 --> 00:16:28,840
You're out of fuel.

145
00:16:29,320 --> 00:16:30,360
Come down !

146
00:16:33,560 --> 00:16:34,680
How dare you !?

147
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:36,880
You...

148
00:16:36,880 --> 00:16:37,960
A mere Core Formation...

149
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:40,840
A mere Core Formation brat !

150
00:17:01,520 --> 00:17:04,240
They... saw us !

151
00:17:15,760 --> 00:19:37,720
A life artifact is similar to a blood-refined artifact. The cultivator links his life to an artifact. Although it makes the artifact stronger and it makes the artifact grow together with the cultivator's cultivation level, if the life artifact is destroyed, the consequences are terrible for the cultivator.

The Poison King Cauldron was Hunchback Meng's life artifact. After it was destroyed, he was greatly weakened. That's part of the reason why Wang Lin was able to finish him off.

152
00:17:44,230 --> 00:17:51,110
Count the specks of time

153
00:17:48,110 --> 00:17:51,110
floating down gently.

154
00:17:51,470 --> 00:17:57,350
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny

155
00:17:58,470 --> 00:18:04,870
Forever lock away the scars

156
00:18:02,270 --> 00:18:04,870
of this mortal life.

157
00:18:05,130 --> 00:18:11,390
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

158
00:18:12,030 --> 00:18:19,110
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

159
00:18:14,710 --> 00:18:19,110
that fills the sky with a myriad of colors.

160
00:18:19,190 --> 00:18:26,270
The night-blooming flower cannot drink

161
00:18:21,230 --> 00:18:26,270
the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.

162
00:18:26,710 --> 00:18:28,790
I will ask the heavens who exactly

163
00:18:28,790 --> 00:18:33,550
sliced open this world

164
00:18:30,190 --> 00:18:33,550
to let the rain fall in.

165
00:18:33,550 --> 00:18:35,550
I will refine the world

166
00:18:35,630 --> 00:18:38,070
to make our palm lines say

167
00:18:38,270 --> 00:18:40,430
that we will live forever.

168
00:18:40,430 --> 00:18:43,350
Walking off the beaten path

169
00:18:43,350 --> 00:18:46,430
through heaven and earth.

170
00:18:47,710 --> 00:18:53,390
Before returning to dust,

171
00:18:49,630 --> 00:18:53,390
I will refine this mortal body.

172
00:18:54,910 --> 00:19:02,270
The left shore is the joyous laughter

173
00:18:58,790 --> 00:19:02,270
that can brighten up a thousand years of sadness.

174
00:19:02,270 --> 00:19:08,870
The right shore is an eternal silence

175
00:19:03,870 --> 00:19:08,870
lingering under the candlelight.

176
00:19:09,070 --> 00:19:11,750
To overturn this fate,

177
00:19:11,750 --> 00:19:16,110
I will walk against the heavens.

178
00:19:16,550 --> 00:19:23,270
I will even gather the clouds

179
00:19:19,070 --> 00:19:23,270
to illuminate the sky for you.

180
00:19:23,670 --> 00:19:27,510
All this sadness was not meaningless.

181
00:19:27,510 --> 00:19:30,830
How many lives and deaths
have passed in the blink of an eye ?

182
00:19:30,830 --> 00:19:36,630
I vow to break

183
00:19:33,070 --> 00:19:36,630
this chess game of fate.

184
00:19:37,950 --> 00:19:47,590
I vow to break

185
00:19:39,750 --> 00:19:47,590
this chess game of fate.
